<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{ site.language }}">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#121212">
<script>try{var t=localStorage.getItem("theme");if(t==="light"){document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme","light");var m=document.querySelector('meta[name="theme-color"]');if(m)m.setAttribute("content","#faf9f6");}}catch(e){}</script>
<title>{% if title and title != site.title %}{{ title }} — {% endif %}{{ site.title }}</title>
{% set pageDescription = site.description %}
{% if page.url != "/" %}{% set pageDescription = content | excerpt %}{% endif %}
<meta name="description" content="{{ pageDescription }}">
<meta name="author" content="{{ site.author }}">
<link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="{{ site.title }}">
<meta property="og:title" content="{% if title and title != site.title %}{{ title }} — {% endif %}{{ site.title }}">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ pageDescription }}">
<meta property="og:url" content="{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}">
<meta property="og:type" content="{% if tags and 'posts' in tags %}article{% else %}website{% endif %}">
{% if tags and 'posts' in tags and page.date %}<meta property="article:published_time" content="{{ page.date.toISOString() }}">{% endif %}
{# A post can set shareImage in front matter to use its own photo; otherwise the wave photo. #}
{% set pageShareImage = shareImage or "/images/share.jpg" %}
<meta property="og:image" content="{{ site.url }}{{ pageShareImage }}">
{% if not shareImage %}<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
<meta property="og:image:height" content="630">{% endif %}
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:title" content="{% if title and title != site.title %}{{ title }} — {% endif %}{{ site.title }}">
<meta name="twitter:description" content="{{ pageDescription }}">
<meta name="twitter:image" content="{{ site.url }}{{ pageShareImage }}">
{% if page.url == "/" %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "WebSite",
      "name": {{ site.title | dump | safe }},
      "url": {{ site.url | dump | safe }},
      "description": {{ site.description | dump | safe }},
      "inLanguage": "ja"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Person",
      "name": {{ site.author | dump | safe }},
      "url": {{ site.url | dump | safe }},
      "sameAs": [
        "https://www.instagram.com/jonamccallum",
        "https://www.threads.com/@jonamccallum",
        "https://www.youtube.com/@Jonathanmccallum1",
        "https://jonamccallum.substack.com"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>
{% elif tags and 'posts' in tags %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BlogPosting",
  "headline": {{ title | dump | safe }},
  "description": {{ pageDescription | dump | safe }},
  "url": {{ (site.url + page.url) | dump | safe }},
  "image": {{ (site.url + pageShareImage) | dump | safe }},
{% if page.date %}  "datePublished": {{ page.date.toISOString().slice(0, 10) | dump | safe }},
  "dateModified": {{ page.date.toISOString().slice(0, 10) | dump | safe }},
{% endif %}  "author": { "@type": "Person", "name": {{ site.author | dump | safe }}, "url": {{ site.url | dump | safe }} },
  "mainEntityOfPage": { "@type": "WebPage", "@id": {{ (site.url + page.url) | dump | safe }} },
  "inLanguage": "ja"
}
</script>
{% else %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": {{ title | dump | safe }},
  "url": {{ (site.url + page.url) | dump | safe }},
  "description": {{ pageDescription | dump | safe }},
  "inLanguage": "ja"
}
</script>
{% endif %}
<link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="{{ site.title }}" href="/feed/">
<link rel="preload" href="/css/style.css?v=17" as="style">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=17">
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">コンテンツへスキップ</a>
<header class="site-header">
  <a class="site-header__title" href="/">Jonathan McCallum</a>
  <button id="theme-toggle" type="button">ダーク</button>
</header>
<nav class="site-nav" aria-label="サイト案内">
  <a href="/bible/">新約聖書</a>
  <a href="/#gospel-stories">福音の物語</a>
  <a href="/mind-poems/">今日の詩</a>
</nav>
<nav class="return-home-bar" aria-label="English version">
  <a class="return-home" href="https://jonathanmccallum.com{{ page.url }}">Return home to Jonathan <span lang="ja">· ジョナサンへ戻る</span></a>
</nav>
<main id="main">
{{ content | safe }}
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
  <p><a class="return-home" href="https://jonathanmccallum.com{{ page.url }}">Return home to Jonathan <span lang="ja">· ジョナサンへ戻る</span></a></p>
  <p class="translation-note">翻訳がうまくいっているといいなと思っています。たぶん、いくつか間違いがあります。</p>
  <p>{{ site.title }} — <a href="/feed/">RSS feed</a> · <a href="/search/">検索</a> · <a href="/privacy/">プライバシー</a> · <a href="#" id="cookie-settings">Cookieの設定</a></p>
  <p>Connect — <a href="https://www.instagram.com/jonamccallum">Instagram</a> · <a href="https://www.threads.com/@jonamccallum">Threads</a> · <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Jonathanmccallum1">YouTube</a> · <a href="https://jonamccallum.substack.com">Substack</a> · <a href="/feed/">RSS</a></p>
  <p>声をかける — <a href="#" data-contact-email data-contact-email-text>メールする</a></p>
  <p>Built with Eleventy, hosted on Cloudflare Pages.</p>
</footer>
    <p class="ask-panel__note">An AI answers from Jonathan's published writing only. It is not Jonathan, and it can get things wrong.</p>
    <form id="ask-form-overlay">
      <label for="ask-question-overlay">Your question</label>
      <input id="ask-question-overlay" name="question" type="text" maxlength="500" placeholder="Ask about Narnia, surfing, Jesus…" required>
      <button id="ask-button-overlay" type="button">Ask</button>
    </form>
    <div id="ask-answer-overlay" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <p class="ask-fallback"><a href="/search/">Or search the writing directly</a> — search always works, even when the chat is resting.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<script src="/js/main.js?v=9" defer></script>
<script src="/js/contact.js?v=1" defer></script>
<script src="/js/consent.js?v=1" defer></script>
<script src="/js/suggest.js?v=1" defer></script>
<script src="/js/interview.js?v=1" defer></script>
<div id="cookie-banner" class="cookie-banner" role="dialog" aria-label="Cookie" hidden>
  <p><strong>Cookie.</strong> このサイトはシンプルです。あなたの端末にライトテーマかダークテーマかを覚えるだけです。ここでは何もあなたを追跡しません。 <a href="/privacy/">プライバシーページを読む</a>.</p>
  <p class="cookie-banner__buttons">
    <button id="cookie-accept" type="button">同意する</button>
    <button id="cookie-reject" type="button">拒否する</button>
  </p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
